      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAND MILLESIME (9) has been thereabouts in some good maidens this campaign. Has been kept on the fresh side for this, kept up to the mark with a Murray Bridge trial. Gets in light with the 2kg claimer engaged. This looks her best chance yet. EXPECTO PATRONUM (2) chased gamely into the placings on debut at Murray Bridge. Is sure to have come on from that and deserves a lot more respect this time despite the wide draw. STRONG MINDED (6) is knocking on the door and doesn't have to improve much to finally get off the mark this time. Draws well for Pannell and is a big chance. KHORASAN (10) has been much better in her last two and strips rock-hard fit. With any further improvement she can play a role. RICH MELODY (5) has only been warming late into his races. If they overdo it early he can play a role.",
